[19:42:30] [PROCESS] Analysis 2 compares the residual mass step to the SALT2 mass step correction (0.0600 mag) and to the TEP prediction for the Cepheid calibration bias difference (kappa_Cep * Delta_X_i, with kappa_Cep=3.6500e+05 mag). The fraction of the TEP signal absorbed by SALT2 is quantified, establishing whether Pantheon+ m_b_corr can test the TEP host-mass prediction.
